Matt meanwhile meets and starts seeing a lot of Becky who also likes him.

6
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Unfortunately her last name is Cullen, and when the rest of the family finds out about their
relationship, they decide to get even, and their harassment is elevated to vicious assault.

